ly images for unstamped items and the background service finishes the mint."}, {"id": "minidapp_index_provenance_ledger", "label": "Provenance Ledger", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "minidapp/index.html", "source_location": "index.html:144-162", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Signature check, web proof check, and an expandable KISS VM contract view."}, {"id": "minidapp_index_web_validation", "label": "Web Validation (tokenvalidate)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "minidapp/index.html", "source_location": "index.html:60-63", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Creator hosts a public .txt containing the tokenid; provable via tokenvalidate, surfacing as a verified shield in the provenance ledger and as an extra warning before burial."}, {"id": "minidapp_index_certificate_of_identity", "label": "Certificate of Identity", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "minidapp/index.html", "source_location": "index.html:280-288", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Identity travels in coin state \u2014 the number and the image are re-created verbatim on every transfer, enforced by consensus; the chain is the certificate."}, {"id": "minidapp_index_mds_js", "label": "mds.js (script include)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "minidapp/index.html", "source_location": "index.html:8", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "minidapp_index_engine_js", "label": "engine.js (script include)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "minidapp/index.html", "source_location": "index.html:9", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "minidapp_index_app_js", "label": "app.js (script include)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "minidapp/index.html", "source_location": "index.html:332", "source_url": null, "captured_